<section class="hero panel">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Outreach Email Template Generator</p>
    <h1>Build thoughtful outreach drafts from a reviewable template library.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Structured templates for link building, PR mentions, guest posts, and brand partnerships.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/generator" class="btn">Generate Email</a>
      <a href="/templates" class="btn btn-secondary">Browse Templates</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-metrics" aria-label="Catalog summary">
    <div><strong><%= catalogStats.templateCount %></strong><span>Templates</span></div>
    <div><strong><%= catalogStats.categoryCount %></strong><span>Campaign Categories</span></div>
    <div><strong>3</strong><span>Tone Profiles</span></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="feature-grid">
  <article class="panel feature-card">
    <h2>Personalization Tokens</h2>
    <p>
      Auto-inject fields like {firstName}, {siteName}, and compliment snippets with safe rendering.
    </p>
  </article>
  <article class="panel feature-card">
    <h2>Follow-ups</h2>
    <p>Generate follow-up #1 and #2 from structured sequence templates.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="panel feature-card">
    <h2>Export</h2>
    <p>Copy, download TXT, and export CSV rows for campaign operations.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="panel feature-card">
    <h2>Favorites</h2>
    <p>Pin preferred templates and filter the library instantly.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="panel feature-card">
    <h2>History</h2>
    <p>Store and retrieve previous generations with search and sort controls.</p>
  </article>
</section>
<section class="faq panel">
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <details>
      <summary>How does drafting work?</summary>
      <p>
        Select a version-controlled template, provide campaign details, and review the resulting
        plain-text draft.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I save outputs?</summary>
      <p>Yes, authenticated users can save to history and revisit at any time.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I customize outreach tone?</summary>
      <p>Yes, choose direct, friendly, or formal tone controls.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Do you support follow-up emails?</summary>
      <p>Yes, each template can include follow-up #1 and #2 variants.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Are templates searchable?</summary>
      <p>Yes, by category and keyword without page reload.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Does it support favorites?</summary>
      <p>Yes, favorite templates and filter to favorites only.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can anonymous users use generator?</summary>
      <p>No, generator and history require account login.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I export generated emails?</summary>
      <p>Yes, copy subject/body, download TXT, and export a CSV row.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
